      "text": "In a X Post shared by the ministry, it said: \"All domestic LPG consumers are required to complete Biometric Aadhaar Authentication (e-KYC). Now verify from the comfort of your home using your Oil Marketing Company's mobile app and Aadhaar FaceRD app.\"",
